            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Interesting idea. Do you often encounter need for this?\r\n\r\nYes I mostly encounter it with filetypes like `svelte`, `vue`, and `html` with embedded `css` or `js`.\r\n\r\n> I wonder if a better design would be to call hooks safely with pcall() and stop further execution in case of an error.\r\n\r\nThat means if I wanted to abort I'd have to cause a error right?, It's a good thing to have but I don't think it's how we should abort.",
