        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> That's my concern as well.\r\nWhy is calling a hook with an argument discouraged?\r\nBtw I was the guy who requested passing session data as an argument into session hooks, Did those cause an issue?\r\n\r\nYeah, I remember that. Hello :)\r\nI don't particularly like the idea of supplying an `abort` argument.\r\n\r\nMaybe even better idea might be to allow hooks to return a value. If it is true-ish, then continue execution. Stop otherwise. ",
